<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on Credit Suisse.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on Credit Suisse.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland said it has issued 20 million American-style call warrants on registered shares of CS Holding.</p>
<p>Five warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    140 CHF		   PREMIUM	12.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.88 CHF		  GEARING	14.2 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 17.JAN.97-20.MAR.98   PAYDATE	17.JAN.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  133.0 CHF		 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
